---

FolkTech AI was founded by Mike Folk, a paramedic, educator, and developer who believed that AI could revolutionize human health, education, and communication.

The company started with a simple vision — to build AI tools that served real-world needs, starting with EMS and healthcare. Pocket Medic, Serena, and Jake are just the beginning.

